  m_text: "GUIDE\n\nDeal Damage to Frankenstein with ATTACK CARDS and protect yourself
    with SHIELD CARDS.\n\nEach card consists of two halves which can be SPLIT in two
    and MERGED back together to create your own combination cards.\n\nAny HALF CARDS
    not used before playing your cards will be discarded for the next round.\n\nCOST
    PER TURN LIMIT: \n10\n\n\n\n\n\n"
